WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.389
Three parts launch.

00:00:01.399 --> 00:00:03.076
Only two fly again.

00:00:03.086 --> 00:00:06.380
First, the orbiter's three
main engines light.

00:00:06.390 --> 00:00:08.560
Only once those run smoothly can the

00:00:08.570 --> 00:00:09.960
boosters ignite:

00:00:09.970 --> 00:00:12.727
85 percent of the liftoff push.

00:00:12.737 --> 00:00:14.718
Two minutes up, they drop away and

00:00:14.728 --> 00:00:17.847
parachute into the Atlantic, to fly again.

00:00:17.857 --> 00:00:20.847
The orbiter glides home to a runway.

00:00:20.857 --> 00:00:22.822
So which part was thrown away?

00:00:22.832 --> 00:00:24.485
The giant fuel tank:

00:00:24.495 --> 00:00:26.010
it fed the engines for eight and

00:00:26.020 --> 00:00:28.182
a half minutes, then dropped.
